Package: slicejam
Title: Jam Slice ChIP-seq/ATAC-seq peak slice analysis
Version: 0.0.38.900
Authors@R: person(given="James M.", family="Ward",
   email="jmw86069@gmail.com", role=c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Jam Slice ChIP-seq/ATAC-seq peak slice analysis.
   Peak count import, normalization, MA-plot data QC, statistical
   group determination, differential peak analysis, Venn diagrams,
   volcano plots, heatmaps.
